usage: niagara_help export [-h] [--html | --module] name file

positional arguments:
  name        Class name (e.g. BAlarmService), or a module name with --module
  file        Output .md file path (.html with --html)

options:
  -h, --help  show this help message and exit
  --html      Standalone HTML class report (replaces export-html)
  --module    Full module report in markdown (replaces export-module)
